    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Selectat \u00een sec\u021biunea Forum a Berlinalei, documentarul are o form\u0103 neconven\u021bional\u0103: \u00eempreun\u0103 cu tat\u0103l s\u0103u, regizorul urm\u0103re\u0219te un vechi meci de fotbal \u00eenregistrat pe o caset\u0103 VHS. Tat\u0103l a fost atunci arbitrul meciului. \u00centre cei doi se na\u0219te o discu\u021bie, care trece peste tema fotbalului, ajung\u00e2nd la politic\u0103, represiuni \u0219i amintiri.",
        "english": "Filmmaker Corneliu Porumboiu discusses a snowy soccer match from 1988 with his father, who was the head referee for the game."
